acer-predator-ph315-51-fan-control (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Grant access through a fanctl group and systemd socket activation
    instead of a hard-coded UID.
  * Read the fan mode back from the EC, restore auto when the daemon stops,
    and refuse to run on models other than the PH315-51.
  * Load ec_sys from the unit, harden the service, add --version.

